\section{Using figure placeholders}{

You can write a placeholder such as \verb{fg\{tag = demo_map\}} inside a remarks or etymology paragraph. The placeholder identifies figure metadata instead of a fixed number, so figure renumbering does not require editing that paragraph.

Normally you do not need to call this function directly: \code{finalise_taxRmatic_text()} can replace the tags while preparing the complete manuscript.
